  "goodToKnow": "Der Schulleiter (die Schulleiterin) is a head teacher or principal; traditional titles are Rektor (primary and secondary schools) and Direktor or Oberstudiendirektor (Gymnasium). Die Schulleitung is the school management. German head teachers still teach classes themselves, and many schools struggle to fill head positions because of heavy workloads. Plural: die Schulleiter."
